          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>A slim staff of pale ash, banded at three points with worn brass. The head is a loose cage of brass wire holding nothing at all &mdash; whatever it was made to carry is long gone, and the empty setting catches the light in a way that makes people glance twice.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w]{Telekinetic Hand} @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yyz029C9eqfY38PT]{Telekinetic Rend}</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{Soothe}</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{Soothe}</li><li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{Soothe}</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>"
